1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:58,850
Have you ever felt like God is far away?
Like your prayers hit the ceiling?

2
00:00:58,850 --> 00:02:21,610
As the deer pants for streams of water, so
my soul pants for you, my God. My soul
thirsts for God, for the living God.

3
00:02:21,610 --> 00:03:45,960
So do not fear, for I am with you; do not
be dismayed, for I am your God.

4
00:03:45,960 --> 00:05:10,649
We are hard pressed on every side, but not
crushed; perplexed, but not in despair.

5
00:05:10,649 --> 00:06:35,000
Because of the Lord's great love we are
not consumed, for his compassions never
fail.

6
00:06:35,000 --> 00:07:51,490
The righteous cry out, and the Lord hears
them; he delivers them from all their
troubles.

7
00:07:51,490 --> 00:09:07,170
Come to me, all you who are weary and
burdened, and I will give you rest.

8
00:09:07,170 --> 00:10:33,220
May the God of hope fill you with all joy
and peace as you trust in him.

9
00:10:33,220 --> 00:11:19,430
Let us pray. Heavenly Father, thank you
for being near even when we feel alone.
Amen.

10
00:11:19,430 --> 00:20:00,000
[Music - Parchment Silence]

